  "thesis": "When the prior fourteen complete daily BTC typical-price money flows remain net positive enough to keep MFI above its equal-flow midline, price movement may be supported by volume strongly enough that a causal next-open long/cash policy preserves material upside while avoiding enough adverse paths to improve fee-adjusted risk-adjusted performance over full-capital buy-and-hold.",
  "economic_rationale": "MFI14 combines typical-price direction and base volume in a bounded rolling ratio. It is valuable only if the fixed 50 equal-flow boundary retains material upside after costs, lowers drawdown, improves Calmar, survives annual breadth and remains stable at frozen thresholds 45 and 55. Reduced exposure alone cannot pass.",
  "opportunity_cost": "One exact historical decision is cheaper and more informative than waiting ninety days or building another data adapter. A failure permanently closes this MFI14 midline family without threshold, length, smoothing, band, divergence or parent changes.",
